    "tpc_book": "<div>音樂相關：學術類</div>\n\n<div>Fjelds&oslash;e, Michael, and Sanne Krogh Groth. 2019. &quot;&lsquo;Nordicness&rsquo; in Scandinavian music: A complex question.&quot;&nbsp;<em>The Nature of Nordic Music</em>. Routledge. 3-19.</div>\n\n<div>Holt, Fabian, and Antti-Ville K&auml;rj&auml;, eds. 2017.&nbsp;<em>The Oxford Handbook of Popular Music in the Nordic Countries</em>. Oxford University Press.</div>\n\n<div>\n<div>Johansson, Ola. 2010. &quot;Beyond ABBA: the globalization of Swedish popular music.&quot;&nbsp;<em>FOCUS on Geography</em>&nbsp;53(4): 134-141.</div>\n</div>\n\n<div>Mellor, Andrew. 2022.&nbsp;<em>The Northern Silence: Journeys in Nordic Music and Culture</em>. Yale University Press.</div>\n\n<div>Rice, Timothy, James Porter, and Chris Goertzen, eds.&nbsp;2017. <em>The Garland encyclopedia of world music: Europe</em>. Routledge.</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>歷史人文：一般讀物（近5年新書）</div>\n\n<div>Arthur Herman，《維京魂：忠誠、紀律、無畏，征服世界的北歐傳奇》，台北：聯經（2025）。譯：馮奕達。</div>\n\n<div>Stein Ringen，《冰與血之歌：北歐千年史》，台北：衛城出版（2025）。譯：盧靜。</div>\n\n<div>村井誠人（監修）, 大溪太郎（監修），《極簡北歐史》，台北：楓樹林出版（2025）。譯：陳聖怡。</div>\n\n<div>白蓮欣, 凱特琳，《北歐神話故事》，台北：好讀（2024）。</div>\n\n<div>瑞典劉先生（劉晉亨），《斯德哥爾摩宜居指引：劉先生的十二年瑞典駐地觀察與剛剛好文化剖析》，台北：時報（2023）</div>\n\n<div>Nikolai Brandal, &Oslash;ivind Bratberg, Dag Einar Thorsen，《北歐不是神話：一套打造永續幸福國度的方法》，台北：經濟民主連合（2021）。譯：劉維人。</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>歷史人文：學術類</div>\n\n<div>施正鋒。〈挪威的百年獨立努力〉。《台灣國際研究季刊》第17卷第1期（2021）：頁271-294。<br />\n&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>聆聽指南</div>\n\n<div>\n<div>Iceland Music Hits <a href=\"https://www.icelandmusic.is/en/playlists/iceland-music-hits\">https://www.icelandmusic.is/en/playlists/iceland-music-hits</a></div>\n\n<div>The 100 best swedish songs of all times &ndash; Spotify</div>\n\n<div><a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/playlist/1znpCepiQTkLYxuSCIxruG\">https://open.spotify.com/playlist/1znpCepiQTkLYxuSCIxruG</a></div>\n\n<div>Famous bands and musicians from Norway: A list</div>\n<a href=\"https://planetnorway.com/bands-and-musicians/\">https://planetnorway.com/bands-and-musicians/</a></div>\n",
