      "tpd_learn": "<div>瑞典：</div>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Spotify與聆聽革命</li>\n\t<li>歐洲視野歌唱大賽常勝軍</li>\n\t<li>ABBA：七零年代經典</li>\n\t<li>羅琳(Loreen)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n",
